OL,3,GNEWSATwo in court charged with murder
OL,4,Aover Armadale shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith murdering another man who was shot
OL,8,Fdead in West Lothian.
OL,10,FPolice were called to a property on
OL,11,FHarestanes Road in Armadale at about
OL,12,F11:50 on 12 September.
OL,14,FBilly Watson, 35, was found injured and
OL,15,Fdied at the scene.
OL,17,FCorrie McQueen, 29 and Martin
OL,18,FPatterson, 44, appeared at Livingston
OL,19,FSheriff Court on Monday, charged with
OL,20,Fmurder and attempting to defeat the
OL,21,Fends of justice. Both men made no plea
OL,22,Fand were remanded in custody.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
